#
# Counter-example for gmeow:TeachingShape: the learner (ex:tool) is a
# gmeow:Artifact, not a gmeow:Agent. The learner property shape carries
# sh:class gmeow:Agent, so validation MUST emit shacl.ClassConstraintComponent
# (and no other finding — learner minCount 1 is satisfied by ex:tool, teacher is a
# valid distinct Agent, subjectTaught is present, and teacher != learner).
# Bound by tests/example-conformance.ttl (ex:ecTeachingNonAgentLearner).
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/lrn/> .

ex:alice a gmeow:Agent .
ex:tool a gmeow:Artifact .
ex:welding a gmeow:Skill .

ex:bad2 a gmeow:Teaching ;
    gmeow:teacher ex:alice ;
    gmeow:learner ex:tool ;
    gmeow:subjectTaught ex:welding .
